  "name": "rustaceans.org",
  "description": "A community-maintained metadata registry for Rust language contributors, serving as the primary data source for the rustaceans.org directory. It utilizes a GitOps workflow where members manage personal profiles through structured JSON files submitted via GitHub Pull Requests. The repository facilitates decentralized identity management and community networking by providing a version-controlled record of contributor interests and communication handles.",
